	<modelVersion>4.0.0</modelVersion>

	<!--
		Shared parent of every Monflabs Maven project: Galta-Java itself (its root
		pom references this file by relativePath, so a fresh clone builds without
		anything installed) and the peer repositories (Galta-Java-Private, UbiGen,
		RestQL, DraftDB, Salesforce, Commerce, DeveloperToolbox), which reference
		it by coordinates.

		It holds, in ONE place:
		  - the Java level and encodings (properties),
		  - the version of every third-party library used by the Monflabs
		    projects (dependencyManagement - declare dependencies without a
		    version),
		  - the version and default configuration of every Maven plugin
		    (pluginManagement - declare plugins without a version),
		  - the build rules applied everywhere (enforcer, flatten, jacoco),
		  - the release profiles (javadoc, sources, codesigning, central) and an
		    on-demand dependency-analyze profile,
		  - the metadata shared by every repository (organization, license,
		    developers). url, scm and issueManagement are per repository.

		Galta's own artifacts are NOT managed here: import org.monflabs.galta:galta-bom
		for them (a BOM for consumers, which must not carry these third-party pins).

		The version is a literal, not ${revision}: this pom has no parent to
		inherit the property from, and a literal version is what children
		reference anyway. Keep it equal to the Galta ${revision}.
	-->
